1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,072
Same person. Same day. Two very different choices.

2
00:00:05,422 --> 00:00:09,761
Morning. One scrolls in bed for an hour. The other gets up and moves.

3
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:14,723
Lunch. One grabs fast food. The other eats a real meal.

4
00:00:15,873 --> 00:00:21,303
Night. One binges shows until two a.m. The other reads and sleeps on time.

5
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:27,361
Money. One buys whatever they want right now. The other saves for something bigger.

6
00:00:28,511 --> 00:00:33,295
One day won't change much. But a whole year of days? That's two different lives.

7
00:00:34,645 --> 00:00:37,780
Which one are you most days? Be honest in the comments.

